[statement]
As `a-dependency-is-decided-where-the-walk-reaches-the-package`, with `z`
listed first: `S` is decided first, for `s1`, which holds `K`, and `F` then
goes to `f2`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:z base

P:base
V:1

P:z
V:1
D:S

P:e
V:1
i:base
D:F

P:f1
V:1
k:100
p:F K=1

P:f2
V:1
k:10
p:F

P:s1
V:1
k:100
p:S K=1

P:s2
V:1
k:10
p:S

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install s1 1
install z 1
install base 1
install f2 1
install e 1
install top 1
